model {
  extend basalt.toolsGateway {
    metadata {
      constraint "Only exact reviewed Basalt server/browser/source tuples may select a framework adapter. Recompute bytes before compile, format1 or format2 load, declaration, facet and Workflow execution; numeric protocols, dependencies and labels do not establish lineage. The same immutable host registry reaches local, self-host and remote runners. Unknown or conflicting identity, missing or corrupt objects, changed immutable-build admission and protocol disagreement retain the typed provenance refusal before authored side effects. Released p39 and p40 grammar stays frozen; p42 alone admits underscore host metadata, while all retained account adapters filter metadata after sealing without changing grants or cardinality. New publication must match the reviewed source and module hashes. Existing retained objects and browser assets are never relabelled or overwritten to pass admission."
    }
  }
}
